<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 233 FOR NINE AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 233 FOR NINE AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, in reply to Australia's first innings 219 all out, were 233 for nine at close of play on the second day of the third test at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 219 (Greg Blewett 62, Curtly Ambrose five for 55); West Indies 233 for nine (Shivnarine Chanderpaul 58, Jimmy Adams 54 not out, Junior Murray 53).</p>
